From 8e5a7de7c99b2572157847ba1f505c9657d97d7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:44:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire: UFS phy and inline crypto like stock (CLO r1-12800)

Stock sapphire builds phy-qcom-ufs, crypto-qti-common/tz, cqhci-crypto
and ufshcd-crypto-qti from CLO KERNEL.PLATFORM.2.0.r1-12800: back to the
void ufs_qcom_phy_save_controller_version() and is_boot_dev_type_emmc()
crypto API, so their export CRCs match the stock (Xiaomi) ufs_qcom.ko.
cqhci keeps the current core with upstream stable fixes.

ufs_qcom itself stays stock: it is Xiaomi's own copy of the UFS core and
embeds UFS firmware images it can flash at boot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
